<title>BELGIUM: EU reviews AXA takeover of UAP.</title>
<headline>EU reviews AXA takeover of UAP.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Wednesday it was starting a preliminary probe into the proposed acquisition of French insurance firm UAP by rival company AXA SA.</p>
<p>The deal, which was presented more like a merger earlier this month, will create the world's second largest insurer after Japan's Nippon Life.</p>
<p>The Commission said in a notice published in the Official Journal C357 that the operation was submitted for clearance under the merger regulation on November 19. It has one month from that date to decide whether to clear it or start an in-depth four-month inquiry.</p>
</text>
